{"id":"e9a7b951-aa8f-4cb2-9d30-aaf354d4236b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"379342ae02c98cbd","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/repo-load.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"36552d5de93449783bfb29ce5e4647ad6b65036f","start":1957,"end":2018},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","signedIn","=","await","(","await","import","(","\"","./session","\"",")",")",".","viaProxy","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"c4f13c82c33e28c1","after":"cb2e0878097a0242"}},"payload":{"text":"Through the proxy by the session itself, not `githubUser` (fetched after it): a load from the address runs before\nthat. Signed in by email or a password, it's as signed out: GitHub straight, public repos only.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:41:20.385Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:41:20.385Z"}
{"id":"f22ff9d3-a534-4cf1-bba9-686578e1d672","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ee790c8f88ebff7f","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/repo-load.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"41cbd813ff8a955c488e542182552a8611a7c84e","start":3852,"end":3931},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","binding","=","{","\"","owner","\"",":","owner",",","\"","repo","\"",":","repo",",","\"","branch","\"",":","meta",".","default_branch","}"]},"context":{"before":"900757189715f7d0","after":"3f32e3cdbca1e0ab"}},"payload":{"text":"Remember where this workspace came from so a commit knows where to push.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:41:14.237Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:41:14.237Z"}
{"id":"ff06a0c8-791a-4ceb-b821-5d247a4e38ef","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"edbac8e8befa5608","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/repo-load.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"bd80dc395ad4b9df21dff1cd0c2487fceaff871d","start":5357,"end":5476},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","locks","=","typeof","navigator","===","\"","undefined","\"","?","undefined",":","(","navigator","as","Navigator","&","{","\"","locks","\"","?",":","LockManager","}",")",".","locks"]},"context":{"before":"817352af4623c427","after":"60cca86b341dc8e1"}},"payload":{"text":"One tab's load at a time, in a workspace (an instance's own): every tab keeps its own copy of the workspace, from its\nstore as it booted, so two back from a reset each found no repository and each cloned into the one store. A tab\nthat finds another loading doesn't: it says so, and a reload once that's done opens what it loaded.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:41:07.523Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:41:07.523Z"}
